{"protocol_version": 1, "event_id": 3, "world_id": "local-猩红文档-20260916-050005-1fa5", "sequence": 3, "revision": 5, "type": "action_status", "cause_request_id": "274b5370-1595-4fb2-aeba-8c5600f60364", "payload": {"request_id": "run_d6b8d1f822480daf-s0-c0", "status": "completed", "outcome": "success"}}
{"protocol_version": 1, "event_id": 5, "world_id": "local-猩红文档-20260916-050005-1fa5", "sequence": 5, "revision": 5, "type": "message_completed", "cause_request_id": "274b5370-1595-4fb2-aeba-8c5600f60364", "payload": {"speaker": {"kind": "npc", "id": "bryce_fallon"}, "text": "（法伦主任推了推眼镜，语气沉重）是的，查尔斯·莱特教授……校方的说法是严重突发心力衰竭，就在他自己的办公室里。事情发生得很突然，我们谁都没想到。你们既然要接手这件事，这些情况你们迟早得知道。"}}
{"protocol_version": 1, "event_id": 6, "world_id": "local-猩红文档-20260916-050005-1fa5", "sequence": 6, "revision": 5, "type": "action_status", "cause_request_id": "274b5370-1595-4fb2-aeba-8c5600f60364", "payload": {"request_id": "run_d6b8d1f822480daf-s0-c1", "status": "completed", "outcome": "success"}}
{"protocol_version": 1, "event_id": 7, "world_id": "local-猩红文档-20260916-050005-1fa5", "sequence": 7, "revision": 5, "type": "action_status", "cause_request_id": "274b5370-1595-4fb2-aeba-8c5600f60364", "payload": {"request_id": "274b5370-1595-4fb2-aeba-8c5600f60364", "status": "completed", "outcome": "success", "detail": "已向法伦主任出示并复述 clue_001 的内容，法伦予以确认。"}}
{"protocol_version": 1, "event_id": 8, "world_id": "local-猩红文档-20260916-050005-1fa5", "sequence": 8, "revision": 5, "type": "action_status", "cause_request_id": "274b5370-1595-4fb2-aeba-8c5600f60364", "payload": {"request_id": "run_d6b8d1f822480daf-s0-c2", "status": "completed", "outcome": "success"}}
{"protocol_version": 1, "event_id": 10, "world_id": "local-猩红文档-20260916-050005-1fa5", "sequence": 10, "revision": 5, "type": "message_completed", "cause_request_id": "274b5370-1595-4fb2-aeba-8c5600f60364", "payload": {"speaker": {"kind": "npc", "id": "bryce_fallon"}, "text": "（法伦主任从抽屉里取出一串钥匙，放在桌上）这是莱特办公室和他那间小屋的钥匙。办公室在文科楼三层，小屋在镇子北边。你们想从哪儿开始，我都可以安排。另外——莱特生前正在评估霍布豪斯家族捐来的那批阿卡姆女巫审判文档，他走后，那些文档就不见了。当时参与评估的还有几个人，你们或许也该找他们谈谈。"}}
{"protocol_version": 1, "event_id": 11, "world_id": "local-猩红文档-20260916-050005-1fa5", "sequence": 11, "revision": 5, "type": "action_status", "cause_request_id": "274b5370-1595-4fb2-aeba-8c5600f60364", "payload": {"request_id": "run_d6b8d1f822480daf-s1-c0", "status": "completed", "outcome": "success"}}
{"protocol_version": 1, "event_id": 12, "world_id": "local-猩红文档-20260916-050005-1fa5", "sequence": 12, "revision": 6, "type": "clue_granted", "cause_request_id": "274b5370-1595-4fb2-aeba-8c5600f60364", "payload": {"clue_id": "clue_002", "investigator_id": "pc", "category": "investigation", "text": "莱特生前正在评估霍布豪斯家族捐赠的阿卡姆女巫审判文档；他死后，这份文档下落不明。"}}
{"protocol_version": 1, "event_id": 13, "world_id": "local-猩红文档-20260916-050005-1fa5", "sequence": 13, "revision": 6, "type": "action_status", "cause_request_id": "274b5370-1595-4fb2-aeba-8c5600f60364", "payload": {"request_id": "run_d6b8d1f822480daf-s1-c1", "status": "completed", "outcome": "success"}}
{"protocol_version": 1, "event_id": 14, "world_id": "local-猩红文档-20260916-050005-1fa5", "sequence": 14, "revision": 7, "type": "clue_granted", "cause_request_id": "274b5370-1595-4fb2-aeba-8c5600f60364", "payload": {"clue_id": "clue_003", "investigator_id": "pc", "category": "task", "text": "法伦主任愿意借出莱特办公室和住处的钥匙；初步调查可以从办公室、莱特的小屋，或参与文档评估工作的人员开始。"}}
{"protocol_version": 1, "event_id": 15, "world_id": "local-猩红文档-20260916-050005-1fa5", "sequence": 15, "revision": 7, "type": "action_status", "cause_request_id": "274b5370-1595-4fb2-aeba-8c5600f60364", "payload": {"request_id": "run_d6b8d1f822480daf-s1-c2", "status": "completed", "outcome": "success"}}
{"protocol_version": 1, "event_id": 17, "world_id": "local-猩红文档-20260916-050005-1fa5", "sequence": 17, "revision": 8, "type": "action_status", "cause_request_id": "274b5370-1595-4fb2-aeba-8c5600f60364", "payload": {"request_id": "run_d6b8d1f822480daf-s1-c3", "status": "completed", "outcome": "success"}}
{"protocol_version": 1, "event_id": 19, "world_id": "local-猩红文档-20260916-050005-1fa5", "sequence": 19, "revision": 8, "type": "message_completed", "cause_request_id": "274b5370-1595-4fb2-aeba-8c5600f60364", "payload": {"speaker": {"kind": "npc", "id": "bryce_fallon"}, "text": "（法伦主任把钥匙串往前推了推）办公室在文科楼三层，走廊尽头那间；小屋在镇子北边，离这儿得走上一阵。你们要是现在就想动身，我让人给你们指路。想先看看遗体的话，医学院地下那间停尸房也归我打招呼——莱特还锁在冷柜里，没动过。"}}
{"protocol_version": 1, "event_id": 20, "world_id": "local-猩红文档-20260916-050005-1fa5", "sequence": 20, "revision": 8, "type": "action_status", "cause_request_id": "274b5370-1595-4fb2-aeba-8c5600f60364", "payload": {"request_id": "run_d6b8d1f822480daf_18", "status": "completed", "outcome": "success"}}
{"protocol_version": 1, "event_id": 22, "world_id": "local-猩红文档-20260916-050005-1fa5", "sequence": 22, "revision": 8, "type": "message_completed", "cause_request_id": "274b5370-1595-4fb2-aeba-8c5600f60364", "payload": {"speaker": {"kind": "keeper"}, "text": "法伦主任把钥匙串留在桌沿，等着你们拿主意。三个去处各有各的门道：文科楼三层那间办公室是事发之地，镇北的小屋是他生前的居所，而医学院地下停尸房里，查尔斯·莱特还锁在冷柜中，等着有人去看他最后一眼。你们打算从哪儿开始？"}}
{"protocol_version": 1, "event_id": 23, "world_id": "local-猩红文档-20260916-050005-1fa5", "sequence": 23, "revision": 8, "type": "action_status", "cause_request_id": "274b5370-1595-4fb2-aeba-8c5600f60364", "payload": {"request_id": "run_d6b8d1f822480daf-s3-c0", "status": "completed", "outcome": "success"}}
