{"protocol_version": 1, "event_id": 30, "world_id": "local-猩红文档-20260916-050005-1fa5", "sequence": 30, "revision": 8, "type": "intent_pending", "cause_request_id": "b0a96e1d-495b-46b0-9e52-50de4f826e9a", "payload": {"request_id": "b0a96e1d-495b-46b0-9e52-50de4f826e9a", "investigator_id": "pc", "summary": "我仔细检查法伦的办公桌，找找抽屉里有没有藏起来的东西"}}
{"protocol_version": 1, "event_id": 32, "world_id": "local-猩红文档-20260916-050005-1fa5", "sequence": 32, "revision": 8, "type": "message_completed", "cause_request_id": "d3f29ca7-d436-4ebe-b63a-84d53fb9177c", "payload": {"speaker": {"kind": "npc", "id": "bryce_fallon"}, "text": "（法伦主任接过钥匙，凑到灯下眯眼看了看，又用拇指摩挲了一下齿纹）没错，就是这一把——我亲手从这串上摘下来给你们的。文科楼三层，走廊尽头那间，门牌上还挂着莱特的名字。你们随时可以过去。"}}
{"protocol_version": 1, "event_id": 33, "world_id": "local-猩红文档-20260916-050005-1fa5", "sequence": 33, "revision": 8, "type": "action_status", "cause_request_id": "d3f29ca7-d436-4ebe-b63a-84d53fb9177c", "payload": {"request_id": "run_45f634d5e6358908-s0-c0", "status": "completed", "outcome": "success"}}
{"protocol_version": 1, "event_id": 34, "world_id": "local-猩红文档-20260916-050005-1fa5", "sequence": 34, "revision": 8, "type": "action_status", "cause_request_id": "d3f29ca7-d436-4ebe-b63a-84d53fb9177c", "payload": {"request_id": "d3f29ca7-d436-4ebe-b63a-84d53fb9177c", "status": "completed", "outcome": "success", "detail": "法伦确认黄铜钥匙正是莱特办公室的门钥匙，并再次指明办公室位置（文科楼三层走廊尽头）。钥匙仍在霍华德手中，未发生转移。"}}
