{"protocol_version": 1, "event_id": 46, "world_id": "local-猩红文档-20260916-050005-1fa5", "sequence": 46, "revision": 11, "type": "action_status", "cause_request_id": "ee2677ae-1081-4fb7-9421-0ff765d22a48", "payload": {"request_id": "run_d688db7efd108e3e_1", "status": "completed", "outcome": "success"}}
{"protocol_version": 1, "event_id": 48, "world_id": "local-猩红文档-20260916-050005-1fa5", "sequence": 48, "revision": 11, "type": "message_completed", "cause_request_id": "ee2677ae-1081-4fb7-9421-0ff765d22a48", "payload": {"speaker": {"kind": "keeper"}, "text": "（法伦主任靠在椅背上，看着霍华德伸手去拉那张办公桌的抽屉，眉头几不可察地动了一下）你们要翻我的桌子，我不拦着——不过里头大多是些院务的旧文件。想找什么，尽管看。\n\n霍华德拉开第一层抽屉，纸张的气味混着旧木头味涌出来。要在这堆东西里看出有没有被人刻意藏起的物件，得靠眼力——掷一次侦查。"}}
{"protocol_version": 1, "event_id": 49, "world_id": "local-猩红文档-20260916-050005-1fa5", "sequence": 49, "revision": 11, "type": "action_status", "cause_request_id": "ee2677ae-1081-4fb7-9421-0ff765d22a48", "payload": {"request_id": "run_d688db7efd108e3e-s0-c1", "status": "completed", "outcome": "success"}}